  "goodToKnow": "Hüllen means to wrap or envelop, a slightly literary word: sich in eine Decke hüllen, in Nebel gehüllt (shrouded in fog). Sich in Schweigen hüllen means to remain silent, a favourite phrase when politicians won't comment. Everyday words are einwickeln or einpacken. Die Hülle is a cover or case: die Handyhülle (phone case). In Hülle und Fülle means in abundance. Christo's wrapping of the Reichstag in 1995 was the Verhüllung of the Reichstag."
